# A yt-dlp checkout under lib/, from before yt-dlp became a package in the
# virtualenv. Nothing reads it any more, but a machine that has not deleted it
# yet would otherwise see several hundred untracked files, and a dirty checkout
# is a checkout that cannot pull.
